          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Meena’s father made some chikki. Meena ate "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of it and her younger brother ate "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of it. How much of the total chikki did Meena and her brother eat together?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
